wayfarer rune runestone waystone teleporter travel recall return~
Fine silver sigils cover the smooth stone, shifting subtly when touched. The rune-stone is attuned to distant realms listed in HELP ZONES. Speak the command 'TELEPORT <destination>' to seek an attuned path, such as 'TELEPORT GRAVE'. While carried, the stone also answers 'RECALL' to draw its bearer home to Midgaard and 'RETURN' to retrace the path from the most recent recall.
~
