banking coffer coinward bank balance withdraw deposit atm teller machine~
Silver runes across the coffer's lockplate are bound to Midgaard's counting house. The enchantment responds to 'BALANCE', 'WITHDRAW <amount>', and 'DEPOSIT <amount>', moving coin between the bearer and the account recorded by the warded ledger.
~
